    {
      "speaker": "甘奈",
      "text": "プロデューサーさん、羽那ちゃん！水平線を見て！白いボートがこっちに向かってきてるよ☆",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "amana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "014",
      "clothId": "014",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "surp2",
      "charAnim2": "face_surp",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
      "lip": "lip_surp",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s2_r01",
        "zh": "制作人先生、羽那酱！快看那边的海平线！有一艘白色快艇正朝这边开过来哦☆",
        "speakerZh": "大崎甘奈",
        "surfaceEmotion": "surprise_wide",
        "innerEmotion": "alert_spark",
        "vocalTone": "bright_pop",
        "note": "[节拍 1] 发现远方海平线上的搜救船",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "发现远方海平线搜救船影"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "羽那",
      "text": "ほんとだぁ……！プロデューサーさん、あたしたちがここにいるって合図を送らなきゃですっ！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "hana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "027",
      "clothId": "027",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 776,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "surp1",
      "charAnim2": "face_surp",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
      "lip": "lip_surp",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s2_r02",
        "zh": "真的耶……！制作人先生，我们得马上发出信号，让大家知道我们在这里才行！",
        "speakerZh": "铃木羽那",
        "surfaceEmotion": "surprise_wide",
        "innerEmotion": "alert_spark",
        "vocalTone": "bright_pop",
        "x-beatId": "beat_1",
        "x-beatTitle": "发现远方海平线搜救船影"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "プロデューサー",
      "text": "よし、遠くの船からでも一目で気づいてもらえるように、一番目立つ合図を出そう！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s2_r03",
        "zh": "好，为了让远处的船只一眼就能注意到我们，用最醒目的方式发出求救信号吧！",
        "speakerZh": "制作人",
        "note": "[分支选项] 选择求救信号方式",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "海岸求救信号分支抉择",
        "selectZh": "在沙滩上画出超巨型可爱的SOS涂鸦！"
      },
      "select": "砂浜に超巨大なSOSイラストを描こう！",
      "nextLabel": "branch_sos"
    },
    {
      "select": "ヤシの葉を大きく振って全力でアピールしよう！",
      "nextLabel": "branch_palm",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "sel_004",
        "selectZh": "举起大椰子叶全力挥舞呼喊！"
      }
    },
    {
      "label": "branch_sos",
      "speaker": "甘奈",
      "text": "賛成っ☆ 甘奈、SOSの周りにハートも大きく描いちゃうね！これなら絶対見つけてもらえるよ♪",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "amana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "014",
      "clothId": "014",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 360,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 0
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile2",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s2_r04",
        "zh": "赞成☆ 甘奈还要在SOS周围画上大大的爱心哦！这样大家肯定一眼就能找到我们啦♪",
        "speakerZh": "大崎甘奈",
        "surfaceEmotion": "joy_bright",
        "innerEmotion": "trust_warm",
        "vocalTone": "warm_soft",
        "note": "[分支A: branch_sos] 沙滩巨型SOS涂鸦路线",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "海岸求救信号分支抉择"
      },
      "nextLabel": "signal_success"
    },
    {
      "label": "branch_palm",
      "speaker": "羽那",
      "text": "はいっ！あたし、大きなヤシの葉っぱを持ってブンブン振っちゃいます！おーい、こっちですよ～！",
      "textFrame": "001",
      "textCtrl": "p",
      "charLabel": "hana",
      "charType": "characters",
      "charId": "027",
      "clothId": "027",
      "charCategory": "stand",
      "charPosition": {
        "x": 776,
        "y": 610,
        "order": 1
      },
      "charScale": 1,
      "charAnim1": "smile1",
      "charAnim2": "face_smile",
      "charAnim4": "eye_front",
      "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
      "lip": "lip_smile",
      "_meta": {
        "uid": "s2_r05",
        "zh": "好呀！我来拿起大大的椰子叶使劲挥舞！喂——我们在这里哟～！",
        "speakerZh": "铃木羽那",
        "surfaceEmotion": "smile_gentle",
        "innerEmotion": "performative_sweet",
        "vocalTone": "sweet_performative",
        "note": "[分支B: branch_palm] 挥舞椰叶呼喊路线",
        "x-beatId": "beat_2",
        "x-beatTitle": "海岸求救信号分支抉择"
      },
      "nextLabel": "signal_success"
    },
    {
      "label": "signal_success",
      "speaker": "甘奈",
      "text": "あっ、船のライトが光ったよ！プロデューサーさん、甘奈たちの合図がちゃんと届いたんだね☆",
      "textFrame": "001",
